# Spec: Dusk 2 training

## Goal
Replace production training quiz UI with Dusk 2 overlay on /$deckId/training.

## Requirements
- appMachine is the only quiz state machine (no useQuizDrill on training path)
- Import videos A1-H4 + ramey-flow into public/videos/, commit as plain blobs
- Equal-split timeline; missing video -> null src + 30s fallback duration
- Clock forfeit: OPTION_CLICK wrong index + Slap In gates UI advance
- Review route unchanged (TrainingScreen)

## Out of scope
- Review mode redesign
- Per-move timestamp files
- Git LFS